<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Ryanair.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Ryanair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's RyanAir Holdings Ltd was rated &quot;buy&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>CSFB said Ryanair's strategy was &quot;one of the best defined in the airline industry,&quot; adding that the stock offered &quot;an opportunity for profit growth in a company that is well-positioned to take advantage of Europe's deregulating airline environment.&quot;</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
